<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said it qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal bond issues slated for competitive sale on Monday.</p>
<p>--Lawrence Township Metro, Ind., $7.5 million General Obligations bonds.</p>
<p>--Oklahoma County ISD #12, Okla., $6.8 million of building bonds.</p>
<p>--Milton SD, Wis., $4.1 million of GO refunding bonds. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
